msgid "Documentation for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Dokumentasi untuk versi terkini Qiskit bosons"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Bosons"
msgstr "Qiskit Bosons"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Bosons {#qiskit-bosons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Bosons {#qiskit-bosons}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-bosons` extends the Qiskit SDK with tools for working on bosonic systems. Within its scope it provides the following:\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-bosons` memperluas SDK Qiskit dengan alat untuk bekerja pada sistem boson. Dalam skopnya, ia menyediakan yang berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An efficient data structure for the representation and manipulation of bosonic operators\n"
msgstr "Struktur data yang cekap untuk perwakilan dan manipulasi operator boson\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework for implementing boson-to-qubit encodings, built around shared level encodings (unary with or without projectors, standard binary, Gray), and a library of common mappers\n"
msgstr "Rangka kerja untuk melaksanakan pengekodan boson-ke-qubit, dibina di sekeliling pengekodan aras kongsi (unari dengan atau tanpa unjuran, perduaan piawai, Gray), dan pustaka pemeta biasa\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework and library of gates for expressing bosonic circuits\n"
msgstr "Rangka kerja dan pustaka gate untuk menyatakan litar boson\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A transpilation pipeline integrated with the Qiskit transpiler process to synthesize bosonic circuits into qubit-based circuits\n"
msgstr "Saluran paip transpilasi yang disepadukan dengan proses Transpiler Qiskit untuk mensintesis litar boson kepada litar berasaskan qubit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Mulakan {#get-started}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package covers the whole path from a bosonic operator to a qubit circuit. You can work in the bosonic regime with both, operator and circuit representation, before you choose a truncation and a boson-to-qubit encoding that plug into the multi-representation transpiler pipeline of Qiskit.\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini merangkumi keseluruhan laluan daripada operator boson kepada litar qubit. Anda boleh bekerja dalam rejim boson dengan kedua-dua perwakilan operator dan litar, sebelum anda memilih pemangkasan dan pengekodan boson-ke-qubit yang dipasang ke dalam saluran paip transpiler berbilang perwakilan Qiskit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of these features are explained in [several guides](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/overview) to help you get started. For an end-to-end overview, start with the [Bose-Hubbard guide](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/bose-hubbard).\n"
msgstr "Semua ciri ini diterangkan dalam [beberapa panduan](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/overview) untuk membantu anda bermula. Untuk gambaran keseluruhan hujung ke hujung, mulakan dengan [panduan Bose-Hubbard](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/bose-hubbard).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Technical discussion {#technical-discussion}"
msgstr "Perbincangan teknikal {#technical-discussion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design intentions {#design-intentions}"
msgstr "Hasrat reka bentuk {#design-intentions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package is deliberately designed to align with Qiskit: it builds on a core implemented in Rust and provides first-party language bindings to Python. Its API intends to draw parallels to Qiskit in order to seamlessly integrate into the workflows of users with experience in programming Qiskit. While there exists no C API right now, the architecture is set up to support one if the need for one ever arises in the future. The architecture of this package is also deliberately analogous to that of [qiskit-fermions](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions).\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini sengaja direka bentuk supaya sejajar dengan Qiskit: ia dibina atas teras yang dilaksanakan dalam Rust dan menyediakan pengikatan bahasa pihak pertama kepada Python. API-nya bertujuan menyerupai Qiskit supaya dapat disepadukan dengan lancar ke dalam aliran kerja pengguna yang berpengalaman memprogram Qiskit. Walaupun pada masa ini tiada API C, seni binanya disediakan untuk menyokong satu jika keperluan timbul pada masa hadapan. Seni bina pakej ini juga sengaja dibuat selari dengan [qiskit-fermions](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A core principle to the design of `qiskit-bosons` was the decoupling of its bosonic circuit representation from its qubitized form. To be more precise: the bosonic circuits are meaningful by themselves and do not require a mapping to qubit space to be interpretable. Furthermore, the bosonic circuit representation cannot make any assumptions about the truncation and boson-to-qubit encoding applied later on. Both enter only at transpile time.\n"
msgstr "Prinsip teras dalam reka bentuk `qiskit-bosons` ialah pengasingan perwakilan litar bosonnya daripada bentuk qubitnya. Dengan lebih tepat: litar boson bermakna dengan sendirinya dan tidak memerlukan pemetaan kepada ruang qubit untuk ditafsirkan. Tambahan pula, perwakilan litar boson tidak boleh membuat sebarang andaian tentang pemangkasan dan pengekodan boson-ke-qubit yang digunakan kemudian. Kedua-duanya hanya masuk pada masa transpilasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation policy {#deprecation-policy}"
msgstr "Dasar penamatan sokongan {#deprecation-policy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We follow [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/) and are guided by the principles in [Qiskit’s deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md). We may occasionally make breaking changes in order to improve the user experience. When possible, we will keep old interfaces and mark them as deprecated, as long as they can co-exist with the new ones. Each substantial improvement, breaking change, or deprecation will be documented in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/release-notes).\n"
msgstr "Kami mengikuti [pengversian semantik](https://semver.org/) dan dipandu oleh prinsip dalam [dasar penamatan sokongan Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md). Sesekali kami mungkin membuat perubahan yang memecahkan keserasian untuk memperbaik pengalaman pengguna. Apabila boleh, kami akan mengekalkan antara muka lama dan menandakannya sebagai ditamatkan sokongan, selagi ia boleh wujud bersama yang baharu. Setiap penambahbaikan besar, perubahan yang memecahkan keserasian, atau penamatan sokongan akan didokumenkan dalam [nota keluaran](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/release-notes).\n"

